handlers.\
Sanitized all $_POST, $_GET and $_FILES inputs using sanitize_text\
_\
field(), absint(),\
sanitize\
_\
file_name(), esc_url_raw(), is_uploaded\
_\
file(), and array_map() where appropriate.\
